&lt;p>All I can say is that the experience was absolutely incredible. It wasn&amp;rsquo;t nearly as cold as I had imagined; in fact, I actually felt quite hot (although the trail difficulty was relatively low). For the detailed video, please look out for my upcoming annual review.&lt;/p>
